
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">


<!--=============HEADER================-->


<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport" />
    <title>NannyMatch - Dịch vụ chăm sóc trẻ đáng tin cậy</title>
    <link href="~/css/homepage.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com?plugins=forms,container-queries"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Quicksand:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap"
          rel="stylesheet" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/icon?family=Material+Icons+Round" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
        /* Auto scroll / Marquee with Drag Support */
        .marquee-container {
            cursor: grab;
            user-select: none;
        }

            .marquee-container:active {
                cursor: grabbing;
            }

        .marquee-track {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            width: max-content;
            padding-bottom: 2rem;
            padding-top: 1rem;
        }

        .marquee-item {
            width: 300px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            white-space: normal;
        }

            .marquee-item img {
                pointer-events: none;
            }

        .nm-nav-shell {
            max-width: 1320px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .nm-nav-frame {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 20px;
            min-height: 72px;
        }

        .nm-nav-frame > a:first-of-type {
            justify-self: start;
        }

        .nm-nav-frame > .nm-nav-links {
            justify-self: center;
        }

        .nm-nav-frame > div:last-child {
            justify-self: end;
        }

        .nm-nav-links {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            padding: 5px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.96);
            border: 1px solid rgba(226,232,240,.92);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(15, 23, 42, .05);
        }

        .nm-nav-link {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 42px;
            padding: 0 16px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #6b7280;
            transition: all .22s ease;
        }

        .nm-nav-link:hover {
            color: #ea580c;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.88);
        }

        .nm-nav-link.active {
            color: #c2410c;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff7ed, #ffffff);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(249,115,22,.10);
        }

        .nm-upgrade-btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            min-height: 44px;
            padding: 0 16px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff7ed, #ffedd5);
            border: 1px solid rgba(245,158,11,.24);
            color: #b45309;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 800;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(245,158,11,.12);
            transition: all .22s ease;
        }

        .nm-auth-link {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 44px;
            padding: 0 16px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            color: #4b5563;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: all .2s ease;
        }

        .nm-auth-link:hover {
            color: #ea580c;
            background: rgba(249,115,22,.08);
        }

        .nm-primary-btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 46px;
            padding: 0 18px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316, #ea580c);
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 800;
            box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(249,115,22,.24);
        }

        .nm-primary-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            box-shadow: 0 18px 34px rgba(249,115,22,.28);
        }

        .nm-icon-btn {
            position: relative;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(251, 146, 60, .16);
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.88);
            color: #6b7280;
            transition: all .2s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(15, 23, 42, .06);
        }

        .nm-icon-btn:hover {
            color: #ea580c;
            background: #fff7ed;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .nm-badge-dot {
            position: absolute;
            top: 6px;
            right: 6px;
            min-width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            padding: 0 4px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316, #ea580c);
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 800;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(249,115,22,.26);
        }

        .nm-panel {
            position: absolute;
            right: 0;
            top: calc(100% + 12px);
            width: min(380px, calc(100vw - 24px));
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.98);
            border: 1px solid rgba(226,232,240,.92);
            border-radius: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 26px 60px rgba(15, 23, 42, .14);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .nm-panel-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 12px;
            padding: 16px 18px 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(241,245,249,.95);
        }

        .nm-panel-title {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #111827;
        }

        .nm-panel-link {
            color: #ea580c;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .nm-notification-list {
            max-height: 360px;
            overflow: auto;
            padding: 8px;
        }

        .nm-notification-item {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: left;
            padding: 14px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            transition: background .18s ease, transform .18s ease;
        }

        .nm-notification-item:hover {
            background: #fff7ed;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .nm-notification-item.unread {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,247,237,.92), rgba(255,255,255,.96));
        }

        .nm-notification-item-title {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #111827;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .nm-notification-item-body {
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #6b7280;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .nm-notification-item-meta {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .nm-notification-chip {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 22px;
            padding: 0 8px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #fff7ed;
            color: #c2410c;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .nm-notification-sender {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #9ca3af;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .nm-notification-item-time {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #9ca3af;
        }

        .nm-empty-state {
            padding: 28px 18px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #6b7280;
        }

        .nm-empty-state .material-icons-round {
            font-size: 28px;
            color: #fdba74;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        @@media (max-width: 767px) {
            .nm-nav-shell {
                padding: 0 12px;
            }

            .nm-nav-frame {
                min-height: 68px;
            }

            .nm-nav-frame {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
            }

            .nm-nav-frame > .nm-nav-links {
                display: none !important;
            }

            .nm-panel {
                right: -8px;
                width: min(360px, calc(100vw - 16px));
            }
        }
    </style>
    @RenderSection("Head", required: false)
</head>
@{
    var isHomePage = (ViewContext.RouteData.Values["controller"]?.ToString() == "Home" &&
                      ViewContext.RouteData.Values["action"]?.ToString() == "Index");
    var currentCtrl = ViewContext.RouteData.Values["controller"]?.ToString() ?? "";
    string NavCls(string ctrl) => currentCtrl.Equals(ctrl, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)
        ? "nm-nav-link active"
        : "nm-nav-link";
}
<body class="font-display bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 transition-colors duration-300" style="background-color: #f9fafb; color: #1f2937;" data-page="@(isHomePage ? "home" : "other")">
    <nav class="sticky top-0 z-50 bg-white/95 dark:bg-card-dark/95 backdrop-blur-lg border-b border-gray-100/80 dark:border-gray-800"
         style="box-shadow:0 1px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.06)">
        <div class="nm-nav-shell">
            <div class="nm-nav-frame">

                <!-- Logo -->
                <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3 hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity flex-shrink-0">
                    <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-100 to-orange-50 shadow-sm">
                        <img src="~/img/nanny-logo.jpg" alt="NannyMatch Logo" class="w-full h-full object-contain" />
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight"
                          style="font-family:'Quicksand',sans-serif; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#EA580C,#F97316); -webkit-background-clip:text; background-clip:text; -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent">NannyMatch</span>
                </a>

                <!-- Nav Links (giữa) -->
                <div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-1 nm-nav-links">
                    <a href="/" class="@NavCls("Home")">Trang chủ</a>
                    <a href="/Search" class="@NavCls("Search")">Tìm bảo mẫu</a>
                    <a href="#how-it-works" class="nm-nav-link">Cách hoạt động</a>
                </div>

                <!-- Actions -->
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex-shrink-0">

                    @if (User.Identity != null && User.Identity.IsAuthenticated)
                    {
                        <div class="relative" id="notificationDropdown">
                            <button type="button"
                                    id="notificationToggle"
                                    class="nm-icon-btn"
                                    aria-label="Thong bao">
                                <span class="material-icons-round text-[20px]">notifications</span>
                                <span id="notificationBadge" class="nm-badge-dot hidden">0</span>
                            </button>

                            <div id="notificationMenu" class="nm-panel hidden">
                                <div class="nm-panel-header">
                                    <div>
                                        <p class="nm-panel-title">Thong bao</p>
                                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Nhac gia han va cap nhat quan trong</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <button type="button" id="markAllNotificationsRead" class="nm-panel-link">
                                        Danh dau da doc
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                                <div id="notificationList" class="nm-notification-list">
                                    <div class="nm-empty-state">
                                        <span class="material-icons-round">notifications_none</span>
                                        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700">Dang tai thong bao...</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="relative" id="userDropdown">
                            <button onclick="document.getElementById('dropdownMenu').classList.toggle('hidden')"
                                    class="flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded-2xl border border-orange-100 bg-white/80 hover:bg-orange-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-800 transition-all">
                                <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-400 to-orange-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm font-bold">
                                    @(User.FindFirst(System.Security.Claims.ClaimTypes.GivenName)?.Value?.Substring(0, 1).ToUpper())
                                </div>
                                <span class="hidden sm:block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
                                    @User.FindFirst(System.Security.Claims.ClaimTypes.GivenName)?.Value
                                </span>
                                <span class="material-icons-round text-gray-400 text-lg">expand_more</span>
                            </button>

                            <div id="dropdownMenu" class="hidden absolute right-0 mt-2 w-56 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl shadow-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 p-1 z-50">
                                <a href="@Url.Action("Index", "Profile")" class="flex flex-col px-3 py-2 border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 mb-1 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 rounded-md transition-all cursor-pointer">
                                    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white truncate">
                                        @User.FindFirst(System.Security.Claims.ClaimTypes.GivenName)?.Value @User.FindFirst(System.Security.Claims.ClaimTypes.Surname)?.Value
                                    </p>
                                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 truncate">@User.FindFirst(System.Security.Claims.ClaimTypes.Email)?.Value</p>
                                </a>

                                @if (User.FindFirst("AuthProvider")?.Value != "google")
                                {
                                    <a href="/Auth/ChangePassword" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 rounded-md px-2 py-1.5 text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700">
                                        <span class="material-icons-round text-base">password</span>
                                        Đổi mật khẩu
                                    </a>
                                }

                                <a href="/Subscription" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 rounded-md px-2 py-1.5 text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700">
                                    <span class="material-icons-round text-base">workspace_premium</span>
                                    Goi cua toi
                                </a>

                                <div class="border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 my-1"></div>
                                <form asp-controller="Auth" asp-action="Logout" method="post">
                                    @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
                                    <button type="submit" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 w-full rounded-md px-2 py-1.5 text-sm text-red-500 hover:bg-red-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700">
                                        <span class="material-icons-round text-base">logout</span>
                                        Đăng xuất
                                    </button>
                                </form>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <script>
                            (() => {
                                const notificationDropdown = document.getElementById('notificationDropdown');
                                const notificationToggle = document.getElementById('notificationToggle');
                                const notificationMenu = document.getElementById('notificationMenu');
                                const notificationBadge = document.getElementById('notificationBadge');
                                const notificationList = document.getElementById('notificationList');
                                const markAllButton = document.getElementById('markAllNotificationsRead');

                                if (!notificationDropdown || !notificationToggle || !notificationMenu || !notificationBadge || !notificationList || !markAllButton) {
                                    return;
                                }

                                const escapeHtml = (value) => String(value ?? '')
                                    .replaceAll('&', '&amp;')
                                    .replaceAll('<', '&lt;')
                                    .replaceAll('>', '&gt;')
                                    .replaceAll('"', '&quot;')
                                    .replaceAll("'", '&#39;');

                                const formatTime = (value) => {
                                    if (!value) return '';
                                    const date = new Date(value);
                                    if (Number.isNaN(date.getTime())) return '';
                                    return new Intl.DateTimeFormat('vi-VN', {
                                        day: '2-digit',
                                        month: '2-digit',
                                        year: 'numeric',
                                        hour: '2-digit',
                                        minute: '2-digit'
                                    }).format(date);
                                };

                                const renderEmpty = (message) => {
                                    notificationList.innerHTML = `
                                        <div class="nm-empty-state">
                                            <span class="material-icons-round">notifications_none</span>
                                            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700">${escapeHtml(message)}</p>
                                        </div>`;
                                };

                                const updateBadge = (count) => {
                                    if (!count || count <= 0) {
                                        notificationBadge.classList.add('hidden');
                                        return;
                                    }

                                    notificationBadge.textContent = count > 99 ? '99+' : String(count);
                                    notificationBadge.classList.remove('hidden');
                                };

                                const loadUnreadCount = async () => {
                                    try {
                                        const response = await fetch('/Notification/UnreadCount', { credentials: 'same-origin' });
                                        const result = await response.json();
                                        updateBadge(result?.data?.unreadCount ?? 0);
                                    } catch {
                                        updateBadge(0);
                                    }
                                };

                                const loadNotifications = async () => {
                                    try {
                                        const response = await fetch('/Notification/My?page=1&pageSize=6', { credentials: 'same-origin' });
                                        const result = await response.json();
                                        const items = result?.data ?? [];
                                        const unreadCount = result?.unreadCount ?? 0;
                                        updateBadge(unreadCount);

                                        if (!items.length) {
                                            renderEmpty('Ban chua co thong bao nao.');
                                            return;
                                        }

                                        notificationList.innerHTML = items.map(item => `
                                            <button type="button"
                                                    class="nm-notification-item ${item.isRead ? '' : 'unread'}"
                                                    data-id="${escapeHtml(item.id)}"
                                                    data-url="${escapeHtml(item.actionUrl || '')}">
                                                <div class="nm-notification-item-title">${escapeHtml(item.title)}</div>
                                                <div class="nm-notification-item-meta">
                                                    <span class="nm-notification-chip">${escapeHtml(item.typeLabel || 'Thong bao')}</span>
                                                    <span class="nm-notification-sender">Tu ${escapeHtml(item.senderLabel || 'He thong')}</span>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="nm-notification-item-body">${escapeHtml(item.content)}</div>
                                                <div class="nm-notification-item-time">${escapeHtml(formatTime(item.createdAt))}</div>
                                            </button>
                                        `).join('');
                                    } catch {
                                        renderEmpty('Khong the tai thong bao luc nay.');
                                    }
                                };

                                notificationToggle.addEventListener('click', async () => {
                                    notificationMenu.classList.toggle('hidden');
                                    if (!notificationMenu.classList.contains('hidden')) {
                                        await loadNotifications();
                                    }
                                });

                                notificationList.addEventListener('click', async (event) => {
                                    const item = event.target.closest('.nm-notification-item[data-id]');
                                    if (!item) return;

                                    const actionUrl = item.dataset.url;

                                    try {
                                        await fetch(`/Notification/MarkRead/${item.dataset.id}`, {
                                            method: 'POST',
                                            credentials: 'same-origin'
                                        });
                                    } catch {
                                    }

                                    item.classList.remove('unread');
                                    await loadUnreadCount();

                                    if (actionUrl) {
                                        window.location.href = actionUrl;
                                    }
                                });

                                markAllButton.addEventListener('click', async () => {
                                    try {
                                        await fetch('/Notification/MarkAllRead', {
                                            method: 'POST',
                                            credentials: 'same-origin'
                                        });
                                    } catch {
                                    }

                                    await loadNotifications();
                                });

                                document.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
                                    if (!notificationDropdown.contains(e.target)) {
                                        notificationMenu.classList.add('hidden');
                                    }
                                });

                                loadUnreadCount();
                            })();

                            document.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
                                var dropdown = document.getElementById('userDropdown');
                                var menu = document.getElementById('dropdownMenu');
                                if (dropdown && !dropdown.contains(e.target)) menu.classList.add('hidden');
                            });
                        </script>
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        <a class="hidden sm:inline-flex nm-auth-link"
                           href="/Auth/Login">Đăng nhập</a>
                        <a class="nm-primary-btn"
                           href="/Auth/Register">Đăng ký miễn phí</a>
                    }
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    @if (ViewContext.RouteData.Values["controller"]?.ToString() == "Home")
    {
    <header class="relative overflow-hidden pt-24 pb-28 lg:pt-32 lg:pb-36">
        <canvas class="hero-beam-canvas" id="heroBeamCanvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

        <!-- Floating particles -->
        <div class="hero-particles" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="hero-particle left-1"></div>
            <div class="hero-particle left-2"></div>
            <div class="hero-particle left-3"></div>
            <div class="hero-particle left-4"></div>
            <div class="hero-particle left-5"></div>
            <div class="hero-particle left-6"></div>
            <div class="hero-particle right-1"></div>
            <div class="hero-particle right-2"></div>
            <div class="hero-particle right-3"></div>
            <div class="hero-particle right-4"></div>
            <div class="hero-particle right-5"></div>
            <div class="hero-particle right-6"></div>
        </div>
        <!-- Glowing orb accents -->
        <div class="hero-orb left" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="hero-orb right" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 -mr-20 -mt-20 w-96 h-96 bg-orange-100 rounded-full blur-3xl dark:bg-orange-900/10">
        </div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 -ml-20 -mb-20 w-80 h-80 bg-pink-100 rounded-full blur-3xl dark:bg-pink-900/10">
        </div>
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
                <div class="hero-col-left text-center lg:text-left space-y-8">
                    <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white leading-tight">
                        Dịch vụ chăm sóc trẻ <br />
                        <span class="text-primary relative">
                            đáng tin cậy
                            <svg class="absolute w-full h-3 -bottom-1 left-0 text-orange-200 dark:text-orange-800 opacity-60"
                                 preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 100 10">
                                <path d="M0 5 Q 50 10 100 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="8"></path>
                            </svg>
                        </span>
                    </h1>
                    <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-lg mx-auto lg:mx-0">
                        Được tin dùng bởi hơn 7 triệu gia đình và bảo mẫu. Tìm người phù hợp hoàn hảo cho nhu cầu gia
                        đình bạn, mọi lúc, mọi nơi.
                    </p>
                    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-card-dark p-2 rounded-2xl shadow-xl shadow-gray-200/50 dark:shadow-none max-w-md mx-auto lg:mx-0 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-2">
                        <div class="flex-1 relative">
                            <span class="material-icons-round absolute left-3 top-3.5 text-gray-400">location_on</span>
                            <input class="w-full pl-10 pr-4 py-3 rounded-xl border-none bg-transparent focus:ring-0 text-gray-900 dark:text-white placeholder-gray-500"
                                   placeholder="Tìm bảo mẫu theo khu vực" type="text" />
                        </div>
                        <button class="bg-primary hover:bg-primaryDark text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold shadow-lg shadow-orange-500/30 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                            <span>Tìm bảo mẫu</span>
                            <span class="material-icons-round text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pt-4 flex items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-1">
                        <span class="material-icons-round text-yellow-500 text-lg">star</span>
                        <span class="material-icons-round text-yellow-500 text-lg">star</span>
